{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Apply the coerced integer to the processed update.** `toServiceInteger` is used only for validation; the original number is later registered unchanged. For example, `CallbackOptions.TimeoutSeconds: 0.5` is accepted because Lambda reads it as `0`, but the local runner schedules a 500 ms timer and records `0.5`. Normalize integer members before validation and registration, and add an end-to-end fractional-timeout test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-rLBQ","finding_digest":"a831caabe69753732abed868585192e6c0810c1536128419b4f381ed43b73fb3","finding_id":"arf_v1_vay4vk7gs5jxgkv63bufqums43","finding_key":"checkpoint-server/validate-update-model::integer-coercion::normalized-value-not-propagated","identity_key":"checkpoint-server/validate-update-model::integer-coercion::normalized-value-not-propagated","line":252,"observation_digest":"ab3b5895146fb49f03506b58e2faf7a0cb5d846c0c4ac01fb63a3f5b0063b275","observation_id":"aro_v1_vm5vrfiun62j6a2qnnmof6xxud","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-testing/src/checkpoint-server/validators/validate-update-model.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-14T15:21:51Z","review_id":"arr_v1_zmmrj2dln6sp3arwakxmixbe7l","reviewed_base_sha":"08ba0f6e29d7faaaaa99a6acde407db9c9854e2f","reviewed_head_sha":"1d90bb084e7f29732154054ca97a6eb99ca52ca4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":252,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":996},"record_id":"art_v1_ycr7boywmgr4x574m326pq3ctc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T15:21:51Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
